"The colors of the wallpaper under the menu bar, which keep it as easy to read as the wallpaper. A moving wallpaper, or one in a folder that macOS protects such as Downloads, gets your own colors." = "采用菜单栏下方墙纸的颜色，菜单栏会和墙纸本身一样易读。会动的墙纸，或放在“下载”等受 macOS 保护的文件夹里的墙纸，会使用你自己设定的颜色。";
